2839	          << "' is yielded at a slot of its own allocation that cannot be shown equal to, or "
2840	             "distinct from, the slot it is carried in, so whether the carry needs a copy is "
2841	             "undecidable here. Subscript the declared allocation with the same expression at both "
2842	             "ends, or give the carry its own allocation.";
