3813	    // (now-reused) initValue, top-down.  Reuse retypes producer/init AssignStmt
3814	    // vars but leaves loop-carry nodes stale; for nested pipelined accumulators
3815	    // that split chain would otherwise force YieldFixupMutator to emit invalid
3816	    // acc->acc tile.move ops (#1352).
